[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15722.389, "timestamp": "04:22:02", "text": "升级。这是一款很有趣的游戏。或者，哦，这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15730.469, "timestamp": "04:22:10", "text": "哦，是《无主之地》吗？油性铅笔 2"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15735.59, "timestamp": "04:22:15", "text": "呃，2.5D，随便你怎么称呼它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15740.07, "timestamp": "04:22:20", "text": "啊，哦，对了，仅供参考。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15741.59, "timestamp": "04:22:21", "text": "如果你对玩游戏感兴趣的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15744.07, "timestamp": "04:22:24", "text": "就像单人游戏一样，《恶灵附身》"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15748.79, "timestamp": "04:22:28", "text": "已在 Epic Games 上线。哪一个？邪恶的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15752.71, "timestamp": "04:22:32", "text": "之内。啊，是那个。啊，是的，我明白了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15754.79, "timestamp": "04:22:34", "text": "它。 《恶灵附身2》也即将到来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15757.349, "timestamp": "04:22:37", "text": "免费提供。我打算两个都买。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15759.03, "timestamp": "04:22:39", "text": "他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15761.229, "timestamp": "04:22:41", "text": "他在我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15764.95, "timestamp": "04:22:44", "text": "渠道。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15767.03, "timestamp": "04:22:47", "text": "因为《恶灵附身》真的是一款很棒的游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15768.96, "timestamp": "04:22:48", "text": "游戏。 是的。虽然年代久远，但它仍然是一款好游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15772.16, "timestamp": "04:22:52", "text": "是的。虽然年代久远，但它仍然是一款好游戏。 [掌声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15779.55, "timestamp": "04:22:59", "text": "好的。是的。是的。是的。"}]